<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Chemapol raises basic capital to CZK 2.5bln.</title>
<headline>Czech Chemapol raises basic capital to CZK 2.5bln.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech petrochemical concern Chemapol Group a.s. on Tuesday said it had raised its basic capital by 826 million crowns to 2.5 billion, through a two-round share issue.</p>
</text>
